# IDEATRIX environment
#
# The app runs fully in demo mode with NO environment variables set:
# registration is validated by a Next.js API route and acknowledged with a
# demo registration ID. No payment or email is sent.
#
# When a production backend is ready, wire it through variables like these
# (all optional today; the code does not read them yet):
#
# REGISTRATIONS_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.org/registrations
# REGISTRATIONS_API_KEY=
# PAYMENTS_PROVIDER_URL=
# EMAIL_TRANSPORT_URL=
